ith a rainbow bridge.\n\nHolding everything together is an enormous ash tree, Iggdrasil.\n\nIts roots run down to the gods, the frost giants, and the dead.\n\nAn eagle sits at the top.\n\nA dragon gnaws at the bottom.\n\nAnd a squirrel runs between them, carrying insults.\n\nAt the well of Meemir, Odin trades one eye for a drink.\n\nThat is why Odin has one eye, a wide hat, and a lot of secrets.\n\nAnd one of those secrets is his own ending, which a seeress has told him.\n\nThen Loki walks in."}